            "# NRI (Nox Rendering Interface) & Vulkan 1.4 Backend",
            "",
            "Noxiouse enforces a strict **Zero Graphics API Leak** rule: all Vulkan headers (`vulkan/vulkan_raii.hpp`, `vk_mem_alloc.h`), **NVIDIA Streamline** (DLSS / DLSS-RR), and **NVIDIA NRD** (Real-Time Denoisers) are completely encapsulated inside `NoxCore/src/NRI/Vulkan/`. All engine and editor code interacts purely with the clean C++20 `NRI` interfaces in `NoxCore/src/NRI/`.",
            "",
            "---",
            "",
            "## 1. Five Core Pillars of the Vulkan 1.4 Backend",
            "",
            "1. **100% Bindless via `VK_EXT_descriptor_heap` ([`DescriptorHeapVK.cpp`](file:///E:/dev/noxiouse/NoxCore/src/NRI/Vulkan/DescriptorHeapVK.cpp))**:",
            "   - Eliminates `VkDescriptorSet`s completely. All textures, storage image mips, buffers, and TLASes are written as raw bytes into a persistently mapped GPU buffer via `vkWriteResourceDescriptorsEXT`.",
            "   - The Sampler Heap pre-populates 7 standard samplers at slots `0..6` (`LinearRepeat`, `LinearClamp`, `NearestClamp`, `Aniso4xClamp`, `Aniso16xRepeat`, `NearestRepeat`, and `ShadowGreaterOrEqual`).",
            "   - Draw/dispatch parameters (up to 256 bytes containing 64-bit `BufferDeviceAddress` pointers and `uint32_t` texture slots) are pushed via `vkCmdPushDataEXT`.",
            "2. **Unified Image Layouts via `VK_KHR_unified_image_layouts` ([`TextureVK.cpp`](file:///E:/dev/noxiouse/NoxCore/src/NRI/Vulkan/TextureVK.cpp))**:",
            "   - Every texture is placed into `VK_IMAGE_LAYOUT_GENERAL` once upon creation or initial upload and remains in `GENERAL` forever.",
            "3. **Shader Objects (`VK_EXT_shader_object`) & Two-Level Disk Cache ([`PipelineVK.cpp`](file:///E:/dev/noxiouse/NoxCore/src/NRI/Vulkan/PipelineVK.cpp))**:",
            "   - Compiles Slang shaders to SPIR-V 1.6 (`cache/shaders/*.spv`) and caches driver binary blobs (`cache/shaders/*.bin` with `NXSB` header). Retains the last working binary in memory (`s_lastWorkingBinaries`) so live shader edit errors never crash the engine.",
            "4. **Multi-Queue Execution & 64 KB Sparse Residency Buffers ([`DeviceVK.cpp`](file:///E:/dev/noxiouse/NoxCore/src/NRI/Vulkan/DeviceVK.cpp), [`BufferVK.cpp`](file:///E:/dev/noxiouse/NoxCore/src/NRI/Vulkan/BufferVK.cpp))**:",
            "   - Discovers up to 3 hardware queues (`Graphics`, `Transfer` DMA, and `Compute` for Async Compute) synchronized via `TimelineSemaphoreVK` and `vkQueueSubmit2`.",
            "   - Commits and releases 64 KB VMA physical memory pages on demand via `vkQueueBindSparse` for `GeometryStreamer`.",
            "5. **NVIDIA Streamline (DLSS-SR / DLSS-RR) & 11 NRD Denoiser Instances**:",
            "   - `DeviceVK` manually hooks Streamline (`slSetVulkanInfo`) and maintains **11 independent NRD denoiser instances** (`SIGMA_SHADOW`, plus `REBLUR` and `RELAX` instances for Reflections, ReSTIR GI, ReSTIR DI, ReSTIR PT, and the Hardware Path Tracer).",
