            "| [`RGResourcePool.h`](file:///E:/dev/noxiouse/NoxCore/src/NoxCore/RenderGraph/RGResourcePool.h) & [`RGResourcePool.cpp`](file:///E:/dev/noxiouse/NoxCore/src/NoxCore/RenderGraph/RGResourcePool.cpp) | Physical GPU resource pool implementing first-fit transient aliasing, persistent bindless slot registration, named history persistence, a 120-frame idle keep window, and a 4-frame deferred release queue. |",
