            "",
            "Noxiouse integrates **Jolt Physics** (compiled with **`JPH_DOUBLE_PRECISION=ON`** for 64-bit Large World Coordinates) for 3D simulation and **Box2D v3** for 2D simulation in `NoxCore/src/NoxCore/Physics/`.",
