            "",
            "## 1. Key Capabilities",
            "",
            "- **Fixed 60 Hz Step & Pose Interpolation**: Physics steps at a deterministic `1/60s` interval while `PhysicsPoseComponent` interpolates between previous and current step poses for smooth high-refresh-rate rendering.",
            "- **SI Meter Conversion Boundary**: Jolt simulates internally in meters (`-9.81 m/s²` gravity), converting to/from project world units (`100 cm/m`) at the `JoltPhysics3DScene` boundary.",
            "- **Colliders & Automatic Compound Shapes**: Supports Box, Sphere, Capsule, Cylinder, Infinite Plane, and Cooked Mesh (`ConvexHullShape` / `MeshShape`) colliders, automatically folding child collider entities into their parent rigid body's `StaticCompoundShape`.",
            "- **7 Joint Types (`PhysicsJoint3DComponent`)**: `Fixed`, `Point`, `Distance`, `Hinge`, `Slider`, `Cone`, and full `SixDOF` constraints with per-axis limits, springs, and motors.",
            "- **Virtual Character Controller (`CharacterController3DComponent`)**: Powered by `JPH::CharacterVirtual` with slope limits, stair step-up, stick-to-floor, and dynamic body pushing.",
            "- **Custom Rolling Resistance (`JoltRollingResistance`)**: Applies opposing contact torque tau = -mu_r * F_n * omega so spheres and cylinders naturally roll to a stop.",
            "",
            "---",
            "",
