            "| :--- | :--- |",
            "| [`Animation/Skeleton.h`](file:///E:/dev/noxiouse/NoxCore/src/NoxCore/Animation/Skeleton.h) | Defines `SkeletonNode`, `SkeletonSkin`, and `Skeleton : public Asset`. |",
