            "| [`Animation/Animator.h`](file:///E:/dev/noxiouse/NoxCore/src/NoxCore/Animation/Animator.h) & [`Animator.cpp`](file:///E:/dev/noxiouse/NoxCore/src/NoxCore/Animation/Animator.cpp) | Evaluates single-clip keyframe channels, morph curves, notify crossings, and Sync Marker phase matching (`SyncedClipTime`). |",
