            "",
            "- **Window > Levels** (Unreal's Levels window): the persistent level and its sub-levels as rows -- the **Current** circle (where new entities go), **Visible**, **Locked**, **Always Loaded / Streamed** -- with **Add Existing Level**, **New Level** (a name; the file is made next to the open scene), **Remove** (asks to save first) and **Move Selection to Current**. Read-only in Play.",
